	(text "Rovi M4 wiring -- ESP32-S3 + 2x TB6612FNG + 4 motors + power bank" (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "3ab3d272-5a74-5d32-860a-ea8f05859ca9"))
	(text "Rovi M4 wiring: four TT motors, two TB6612FNG drivers, ESP32-S3, 5 V power bank. Same pins as WIRING.md.\nRibbon cables: ESP32 left header L4-L10 (GPIO 4,5,6,7,15,16,17) -> D1 R1-R7; right header R4-R10 (GPIO 1,2,42,41,40,39,38) -> D2 R1-R7.\nEach driver has its own STBY (GPIO7, GPIO41), low from boot and unless armed; the TB6612 pull-down holds it low in reset.\nFirmware CHANNELS: D1 A=FL, D1 B=RL, D2 A=FR, D2 B=RR. D2 and the right motors are drawn mirrored; pin numbers are the boards' own.\nVM, 3V3 and GND run along the three rails at the bottom. No current monitor, dead-man or bench supply (ADR-0014)." (at 25.4 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f57f6d8-dc21-5fef-9efb-37a586b5dda9"))
